# Undella Town and its bay (a resort on rippling water: sun on the sand, a breeze from the sea): a bright flute tune in C major
# over strings, a plucked arpeggio like light on the waves, a springy bass and a light beat. At night an ocarina takes the tune,
# slower. Original composition for this game (plan 22 · U7, part b).
